<title>UK: BOE forecasts 800 mln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 800 mln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 800 million stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise repos to May 12 and 13 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before May 13.</p>
</text>
